[
  {
    "id": "fe46a418-8968-5946-a4fa-c05623edc003",
    "pack": "draconic-codex",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:dragon-eye",
    "name": "Dragon Eye",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["catalyst", "consumable", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "draconic-codex",
        "page": 223,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4014"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Cast a Spell (add 1 action)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Even in death, a dragon's gaze is terrible to behold. When used to cast "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "14e2abdf-052f-5a62-a6a0-8b4191474b38"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at 3rd rank or higher, an eye from a dragon causes the spell to manifest some of the creature's fearsome aura and inspire terror. Creatures in the spell's area must attempt a basic Will save instead of a basic Reflex save, and in addition to taking the spell's normal damage on a failure, they're "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "4218b8f3-1756-50cd-a914-6ce750659a62",
            "label": "Frightened 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". This adds the emotion, fear, and mental traits to the spell."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "862a6a94-1bcb-5837-b0fb-a39680bf741d"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Lehtsf2QWj3bQnTV"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 30
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light",
      "category": "catalyst",
      "effect": "862a6a94-1bcb-5837-b0fb-a39680bf741d",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "41625fd6-af9a-5ac3-ace1-5fc9633794a3",
    "pack": "draconic-codex",
    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:dragon-scute-greater",
    "name": "Dragon Scute (Greater)",
    "level": 20,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["catalyst", "consumable", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "draconic-codex",
        "page": 223,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4015"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Cast a Spell"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The thick plates that form the strongest points in a dragon's armor can be used as powerful defensive catalysts. Using one of these scales to cast "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "2e797ff1-fcb3-5e23-af04-bc8fc9271425"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " causes the target's skin to grow a thick layer of draconic scales. Instead of the spell's normal effects, the target gains damage resistance based on the type and dragon's tradition."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The scale can be used with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "mountain resilience",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of 10th rank or higher."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Arcane",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " resistance 10 against all damage from spells"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Divine",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " resistance 20 to spirit, vitality, and void"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Occult",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " resistance 20 to mental"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Primal",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " resistance 15 to bludgeoning, piercing, slashing, and poison"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.989VZoKytQMJYRuR"
    },
    "data": {
